          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_YrVyWT": {
              "type": "_accordion",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "heading": "Comment fonctionne un sac isotherme ?",
                "heading_tag": "p",
                "heading_style": "paragraph",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_custom": "",
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_UkdcFG": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "text": "<p>Un sac isotherme ralentit les échanges de température entre l’intérieur et l’extérieur. Il aide à conserver un repas, une boisson ou une lunch box plus longtemps au frais ou au chaud selon le contenu placé à l’intérieur.</p>",
                    "text_style": "paragraph",
                    "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                    "font_weight": 400,
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "alignment_mobile": "left",
                    "show_read_more": false,
                    "read_more_length": 50,
                    "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                    "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                    "truncate": false,
                    "truncate_length": 2,
                    "margin_top": 0,
                    "margin_bottom": 0,
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_UkdcFG"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_EyWbXa": {
              "type": "_accordion",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "heading": "Combien de temps un sac isotherme garde-t-il le froid ?",
                "heading_tag": "p",
                "heading_style": "paragraph",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_custom": "",
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Yi6PP4": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "text": "<p>La durée dépend du modèle, du remplissage du sac et de la température extérieure. Avec des aliments déjà froids et un pain de glace, la conservation peut durer plusieurs heures. </p>",
                    "text_style": "paragraph",
                    "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                    "font_weight": 400,
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "alignment_mobile": "left",
                    "show_read_more": false,
                    "read_more_length": 50,
                    "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                    "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                    "truncate": false,
                    "truncate_length": 2,
                    "margin_top": 0,
                    "margin_bottom": 0,
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_Yi6PP4"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_zU8z4X": {
              "type": "_accordion",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "heading": "Faut-il mettre un pain de glace dans un sac isotherme ?",
                "heading_tag": "p",
                "heading_style": "paragraph",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_custom": "",
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_6JTzBM": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "text": "<p>Pour des trajets courts, ce n’est pas toujours nécessaire. Pour garder les aliments frais plus longtemps, un pain de glace améliore fortement la conservation thermique.</p>",
                    "text_style": "paragraph",
                    "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                    "font_weight": 400,
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "alignment_mobile": "left",
                    "show_read_more": false,
                    "read_more_length": 50,
                    "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                    "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                    "truncate": false,
                    "truncate_length": 2,
                    "margin_top": 0,
                    "margin_bottom": 0,
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_6JTzBM"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_Eabhyd": {
              "type": "_accordion",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "heading": "Politique de remboursement",
                "heading_tag": "p",
                "heading_style": "paragraph",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_custom": "",
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_9Njihg": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "text": "<p>Nous travaillons rapidement pour envoyer votre commande dès que possible. Une fois votre commande expédiée, vous recevrez un email avec des informations supplémentaires. Les délais de livraison varient en fonction de votre emplacement.</p>",
                    "text_style": "paragraph",
                    "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                    "font_weight": 400,
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "alignment_mobile": "left",
                    "show_read_more": false,
                    "read_more_length": 50,
                    "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                    "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                    "truncate": false,
                    "truncate_length": 2,
                    "margin_top": 0,
                    "margin_bottom": 0,
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
